msgid " <p><strong>There was an error while searching.</strong> Please try again.</p> "
msgstr " <p><strong>Terjadi kesalahan saat pencarian.</strong> Silakan coba lagi.</p> "

msgid ""
" Harvest sources allow importing remote metadata into this catalog. Remote sources can be other "
"catalogs such as other CKAN instances, CSW servers or Web Accessible Folders (WAF) (depending on "
"the actual harvesters enabled for this instance). "
msgstr ""
" Sumber pengambilan data memungkinkan metadata dari katalog eksternal dimasukkan ke katalog ini. "
"Sumber eksternal dapat berupa instans CKAN lain, server CSW, atau folder yang dapat diakses "
"melalui web (WAF), bergantung pada jenis pengambil data yang diaktifkan. "

