msgid ""
"This will flag the source as deleted but keep all its datasets and previous jobs. Are you sure "
"you want to delete this harvest source?"
msgstr ""
"Sumber ini akan ditandai sebagai dihapus, tetapi dataset dan riwayat tugas sebelumnya tetap "
"disimpan. Apakah Anda yakin ingin menghapus sumber ini?"

msgid ""
"This will re-run the harvesting for this source. Any updates at the source will overwrite the "
"local datasets. Sources with a large number of datasets may take a significant amount of time to "
"finish harvesting. Please confirm you would like us to start reharvesting."
msgstr ""
"Proses ini akan menjalankan ulang pengambilan data dari sumber. Perubahan pada sumber akan "
"menggantikan dataset lokal. Sumber dengan banyak dataset dapat memerlukan waktu cukup lama. "
"Pastikan Anda ingin memulai pengambilan ulang."

